e pathway between what changes in parents and the outcomes you expect to observe in children. \nPresentation delivery: You need to slow your pace slightly, articulate each word more clearly, and allow a brief pause after each sentence. At present, the verbal delivery feels somewhat rushed. When you make a small error, take a moment to reset rather than trying to recover immediately.",
